---
const episodeUrl = 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y-fRFiTrrg4';
---
<section class="episode-reference wrap" id="podcast-reference" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="podcast-reference-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Behind the reflection</p>
  <h2 id="podcast-reference-title">A conversation worth exploring</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">The original Huberman Lab conversation with Robert Greene, for anyone curious about presence, childhood wonder and the sublime.</p>
  <article class="episode-card">
    <a class="episode-image" href={episodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Watch Access the Sublime and Live Your Best Life with Robert Greene on YouTube (opens in a new tab)"><img src="/images/references/huberman-robert-greene.jpg" width="480" height="360" loading="lazy" alt="Huberman Lab episode thumbnail: Andrew Huberman and Robert Greene, Access the Sublime" /></a>
    <div class="episode-copy"><p class="small">Huberman Lab · November 2, 2026</p><h3>Access the Sublime &amp; Live Your Best Life | Robert Greene</h3><p>Watch the full original episode, or use the official show notes to find the chapters on attention, childhood and love.</p><a class="button" href={episodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch on YouTube<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><p><a href="https://www.hubermanlab.com/episode/access-the-sublime-and-live-your-best-life-robert-greene" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official show notes &amp; timestamps<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p><p class="small">Original episode and thumbnail: Huberman Lab. Shared as a reference, not a J Sol production or endorsement by the creators.</p></div>
  </article>
</section>
<style>
  .episode-reference { padding-block: 40px 56px; scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
  .episode-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: 28px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: #fff; margin-top: 24px; }
  .episode-image { align-self: start; }
  .episode-image img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; }
  .episode-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .episode-copy h3 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); line-height: 1.2; }
  .episode-copy p { color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .episode-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 18px; } }
</style>
